\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> <strong>How can I check the LNMU UG 2nd Merit List 2026?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Visit the official LNMU admission portal, click on the <strong data-end=\"470\" data-start=\"431\">UG Admission 2026\u201330 2nd Merit List</strong> link, log in using your <strong data-end=\"521\" data-start=\"495\">Application ID/User ID</strong> and <strong data-end=\"538\" data-start=\"526\">Password</strong> (if required), and download your <strong data-end=\"608\" data-start=\"572\">Merit List/Seat Allotment Letter</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> <strong>What details are mentioned in the LNMU UG 2nd Merit List?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The merit list generally contains the candidate\u2019s <strong data-end=\"862\" data-start=\"776\">Name, Application Number, Category, Course, Allotted College, and Selection Status</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> <strong>What should I do after my name appears in the 2nd Merit List?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: </strong>Candidates should download the Seat Allotment Letter, report to the allotted college with the required original documents, complete document verification, and pay the admission fee within the prescribed schedule.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website of <strong>LNMU ?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website of <strong>LNMU </strong>is <st